(52,'KB-0000052','Issue Resolution related to VMware vSphere Enterprise Plus Variant 14, step-by-step guide','published','internal','34','217','2025-08-27 15:38:30','2026-02-03 15:33:12','Product: VMware vSphere Enterprise Plus Variant 14 Summary: PSODs/instability on hosts. Resolution Steps: 1) Collect support bundle. 2) Evacuate & enter maintenance mode. 3) Roll back driver/firmware or ESXi patch. 4) Reconcile vDS/VMKernel configs. 5) Apply fixed patch & validation. Rules: Follow maintenance workflow. document impact. Workarounds: Anti-affinity to avoid affected hosts. pin VM compatibility. Policies & Process: Open SR. attach bundle & timeline.'),
