(69,'KB-0000069','Issue Resolution related to Microsoft SQL Server 2019 Patchset 27, step-by-step guide','published','external','47','4','2025-08-27 15:46:07','2026-01-20 04:55:39','Product: Microsoft SQL Server 2019 Patchset 27 Summary: Instability and increased waits. Resolution Steps: 1) Review ERRORLOG/XE. 2) Fix max memory, NUMA, tempdb. 3) Remove new trace flags. 4) Apply latest CU. 5) Validate with workload replay. Rules: Keep dumps/logs. no ad-hoc config on prod. Workarounds: Reduce MAXDOP. pause heavy jobs. Policies & Process: Update runbook. document RCA.'),
