(92,'KB-0000092','Issue Resolution related to Windows Server 2019 Standard Update 42, step-by-step guide — Crash/Stability','published','internal','62','124','2025-08-27 15:34:23','2025-12-10 15:14:30','Product: Windows Server 2019 Standard Update 42 Summary: Blue screens after KB. Resolution Steps: 1) Analyze dumps. 2) uninstall KB. 3) repair role. 4) reapply fixed patch. 5) soak test. Rules: CAB for roll-forward. preserve dumps. Workarounds: Host isolation. disable new feature flags. Policies & Process: Record RCA in KB.'),
