(126,'KB-0000126','Issue Resolution related to Ubuntu Server 22.04 LTS Variant 64, step-by-step guide — Diagnostics & Recovery','published','external','84','217','2025-08-27 15:44:08','2025-12-09 23:26:16','Product: Ubuntu Server 22.04 LTS Variant 64 Summary: Unstable services after config drift. Resolution Steps: 1) Compare against baseline. 2) Restore unit files/limits. 3) Remove conflicting modules. 4) Reinstall packages. 5) Soak test. Rules: Preserve /var/log. no purge without approval. Workarounds: Disable experimental modules. scale out. Policies & Process: Postmortem within 72h.'),
