(128,'KB-0000128','Issue Resolution related to Oracle Database 19c Patchset 66, step-by-step guide','published','internal','86','178','2025-08-27 15:50:27','2026-03-02 14:21:43','Product: Oracle Database 19c Patchset 66 Summary: ORA-600/7445 or instance crash after patch. Resolution Steps: 1) Review alert/trace. 2) Apply RU/PSU superseding Patchset 66. 3) Tune SGA/PGA & cursor cache. 4) Recompile invalid objects. 5) Validate ASH/AWR improvements. Rules: No undocumented parameters in prod. Workarounds: Reduce parallelism. disable experimental features. Policies & Process: SR with incident packages. RCA recorded.'),
(129,'KB-0000129','Issue Resolution related to Oracle Database 19c Patchset 66, step-by-step guide — Diagnostics & Recovery','published','internal','86','714','2025-08-27 15:48:43','2026-02-07 21:37:43','Product: Oracle Database 19c Patchset 66 Summary: Crash after PSU application. Resolution Steps: 1) Gather incident traces. 2) Roll back PSU. apply fixed RU. 3) Adjust memory/parameters. 4) Recreate problematic indexes. 5) Validate. Rules: Preserve traces. maintenance window only. Workarounds: Throttle heavy queries. move ETL off-peak. Policies & Process: CAB & vendor engagement.'),
