(131,'KB-0000131','Issue Resolution related to Microsoft SQL Server 2019 Patchset 67, step-by-step guide — Diagnostics & Recovery','published','external','87','747','2025-08-27 15:40:59','2025-09-08 18:06:55','Product: Microsoft SQL Server 2019 Patchset 67 Summary: Deadlocks/timeouts and crashes. Resolution Steps: 1) Capture deadlock graphs/perf counters. 2) Regress to last CU if needed. 3) Adjust max worker threads. validate NUMA config. 4) Update drivers/AV exclusions. 5) Validate RPO/RTO tests. Rules: Do not clear logs during incident. preserve dumps. Workarounds: Enable RCSI. disable new features. Policies & Process: Postmortem within 72h. attach XE packages.'),
